<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pălĕar</span></b> ,
		āris, n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the skin that hangs down from the neck of an ox</i>, <i>the dew-lap</i>: <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Hippol. 1041</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a collo palearibus demissis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palearia pendula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 854</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 117</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a mento palearia pendent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 53</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 1, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 45,
				70, § 179</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 3,
				332</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>the throat</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">revocat palearibus herbas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 3, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
